        182.99899291992188,
        438.1400146484375
      ],
      "text": "BEAT Tuberculosis trial",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        445.5989074707031,
        527.4003295898438,
        460.04193115234375
      ],
      "text": "This was an open-label, Phase 3, non-inferiority RCT designed to establish the efficacy and safety of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        458.7989196777344,
        527.4276733398438,
        473.241943359375
      ],
      "text": "a regimen comprising 6 months (24 weeks) of bedaquiline (B), delamanid (D), and linezolid (L), with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        471.9989013671875,
        527.45751953125,
        486.4419250488281
      ],
      "text": "levofloxacin (Lfx) and clofazimine (C) compared with the current South African SoC for the treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        485.19891357421875,
        209.804931640625,
        499.6419372558594
      ],
      "text": "of MDR/RR-TB or pre-XDR TB.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        506.90289306640625,
        527.4476928710938,
        521.3458862304688
      ],
      "text": "The objectives of the trial were to compare the proportion of participants with a successful outcome",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        520.1029052734375,
        527.2176513671875,
        534.5458984375
      ],
      "text": "at the end of treatment and the end of follow-up at 76 weeks after randomization on the study",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        533.3029174804688,
        527.443115234375,
        547.7459106445312
      ],
      "text": "regimen with the proportion with a successful outcome on the control regimen, and to compare",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        546.5029296875,
        521.1182250976562,
        560.9459228515625
      ],
      "text": "the proportion of participants who experienced grade 3 or more significant AEs during treatment.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        568.206787109375,
        527.3578491210938,
        582.6497802734375
      ],
      "text": "Eligible participants between 6 and 12 years diagnosed with confirmed or probable pulmonary RR-TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.9738187789917,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        581.4067993164062,
        527.43212890625,
        595.8497924804688
      ],
      "text": "and aged above 12 years with confirmed RR-TB were randomized to receive either the experimental",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        594.6068115234375,
        459.16070556640625,
        609.0498046875
      ],
      "text": "or SoC regimen. All participants were followed up for 76 weeks from randomization.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        616.3106689453125,
        527.2230224609375,
        630.753662109375
      ],
      "text": "The trial used a treatment strategy in which either levofloxacin or clofazimine was dropped from",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        629.5107421875,
        527.4366455078125,
        643.9537353515625
      ],
      "text": "the regimen depending on FQ DST results: BDLLfxC initiated without delay in the case of unknown",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        642.710693359375,
        527.4354248046875,
        657.1536865234375
      ],
      "text": "FQ-resistance at the time of RR-TB diagnosis (and continued with both levofloxacin and clofazimine",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        655.9108276367188,
        527.3938598632812,
        670.3538208007812
      ],
      "text": "if FQ-DST results could not be obtained); or BDLLfx continued for FQ-susceptible TB; or BDLC for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        669.1107177734375,
        527.392822265625,
        683.5537109375
      ],
      "text": "FQ-resistant TB. Within the trial, outcomes with this treatment strategy were compared with outcomes",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.9738187789917,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        682.3106689453125,
        527.4036865234375,
        696.753662109375
      ],
      "text": "with the recommended all-oral, bedaquiline-containing 9-month or longer regimens (most of the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        695.5107421875,
        527.437744140625,
        709.9537353515625
      ],
      "text": "control group received a 9-month linezolid-containing regimen). The dataset included patients with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        708.710693359375,
        527.6051635742188,
        723.1536865234375
      ],
      "text": "severe TB disease, PLHIV, children aged 8 and above, adolescents and a small group of pregnant and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.99174690246582,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        721.9108276367188,
        527.4443969726562,
        736.3538208007812
      ],
      "text": "breastfeeding women. The regimen could be given for 6 months or extended to 9 months if there",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        735.1107177734375,
        288.6067810058594,
        749.5537109375
      ],
      "text": "was no clinical or bacteriological improvement.",
